# Copy to ~/.config/agent-guard/restricted-read-allow. fnmatch patterns, matched case-insensitively.
# No slash: matches the file name. With a slash: matches the path relative to the project root.
# Files matching a pattern may be read directly by Claude Fable and Opus 5.5; everything else under a root is denied.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
task-state.json
